# @layer         Root Configuration & Sovereign Host Boundary (Track 5 Ops)
# @archetype     config_template | operational
# @version       0.1.3-dev
# @interface_rev Rev 5
# @date          2026-11-18
# @author        CreativeWorkzStudio LLC / ProfessorSeanEX (Seanje Lenox-Wise)
# @repository    https://github.com/Novaking34/OmniCode_Framework
# @system        OmniCode Multi-Track Cognitive Engine, Bare-Metal OS & Studio
# @role          Canonical Runtime Environment Configuration Template
# @maturity      Rev 5 Baseline | v0.1.3 Mass Alignment Wave
# @chassis       flat-env | Zero-secret template mirrored into gitignored `.env`
# @scale         O(1) key-value contract across host, FaithNet, cloud & QEMU
# @seams         in: shell/.env loader | exports: runtime environment defaults
# @invariants    1. Universal 5-Block Lifecycle Protocol (Rev 5).
#                2. Zero live tokens or private keys may ever be stored here.
#                3. Form precedes fullness: copy to `.env` before populating
#                   active host state.
#                4. Local offline sovereignty defaults ON
#                   (`OMNICODE_OFFLINE=1`).
#
# PURPOSE & ARCHITECTURAL ROLE:
#   Defines the safe, version-controlled environment variable template for
#   running OmniCode locally, launching OmniStudio HUD, binding FaithNet
#   (`FNP/1`), running Track 0 QEMU bare-metal verification, or syncing remote
#   hosts.
#
#   ### For Everyday Builders & Non-Programmers:
#   Think of this file as the blank blueprint for your laptop's private
#   settings. Copy it to `.env` (`cp .env.example .env`) and fill in your own
#   passwords or keys there—`.env` stays strictly private on your machine and
#   never uploads.
#
#   ### For Systems Programmers & Engine Architects:
#   Provides deterministic default bindings for Track 2/4 directories, HTTP HUD
#   socket addresses, FaithNet FNP/1 ports, QEMU GDB/VNC sockets, and optional
#   cloud edge endpoints without hardcoding host specifics in source code.
# ==============================================================================

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 2: OPENING BLOCK
# ( Runtime Identity, Coordinate State & Local Sovereign Storage Anchors )
# ==============================================================================
# Execution Environment ("development" | "staging" | "production")
ENVIRONMENT="development"
ORGANIZATION="CreativeWorkzStudio LLC"
OMNICODE_VERSION_COORDINATE="0.1.3-dev"

# Host IP and Port for OmniCode HTTP Web Studio HUD and REST Gateway
OMNICODE_HOST="0.0.0.0"
WEB_PORT="8080"

# Offline Sovereignty: 1 = 100% local operation via Track 4 Vaults & Manifest
OMNICODE_OFFLINE="1"

# Telemetry Logging Level ("trace" | "debug" | "info" | "warn" | "error")
RUST_LOG="info"

# Multi-Track Workspace Directories & Storage Anchor Paths
OMNICODE_STORAGE_DIR="<TRACK 4> : {Variable Storage & Episodic Memory}/storage"
OMNICODE_SCROLLS_DIR="<TRACK 4> : {Variable Storage & Episodic Memory}/storage/scrolls"
OMNICODE_LEXICON_DIR="<TRACK 2> : {OmniCode Language & Standard Library}/lexicon"

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 3: BODY BLOCK
# ( FaithNet Substrate, Optional Cloud Infrastructure & Bare-Metal QEMU Ports )
# ==============================================================================
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3.1 FaithNet Sovereign Networking Substrate (`FNP/1` Submodule)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FAITHNET_PROTOCOL="FNP/1"
FAITHNET_PORT="7777"
FAITHNET_WELL_PORT="8077"
FAITHNET_DOMAIN="faithnet.lan"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3.2 Optional Public Endpoint & Dynamic DNS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PUBLIC_DOMAIN="omnicodestudio.duckdns.org"
PUBLIC_WAN_IP="your_public_wan_ip_here"
PUBLIC_API_URL="http://omnicodestudio.duckdns.org:8080"
DUCKDNS_DOMAIN="omnicodestudio"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3.3 Optional Remote Cloud Host (Oracle VM)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ORACLE_VM_HOST="your_remote_host_ip_here"
ORACLE_VM_USER="ubuntu"
ORACLE_SSH_KEY="/path/to/your/ssh_key.pem"
ORACLE_REMOTE_DIR="/home/ubuntu/OmniCode"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3.4 Optional Edge Tunnel & External AI Bridge Credentials (Keep Masked Here)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_NAME="your_tunnel_name_here"
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_ID="your_tunnel_id_here"
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID="your_account_id_here"
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN="your_cloudflare_tunnel_token_here"
GEMINI_API_KEY="your_optional_external_api_key_here"

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3.5 Track 0 Bare-Metal QEMU Hardware Emulation Ports
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
QEMU_GDB_PORT="1234"
QEMU_VNC_PORT="5900"

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 4: AUDIT PROCEDURES BLOCK
# ( Secret Quarantine & Template Hygiene Verification )
# ==============================================================================
# Pre-flight verification commands:
#   1. Confirm live `.env` is strictly quarantined by `.gitignore`:
#        git check-ignore -v .env
#   2. Confirm `.env.example` contains zero live tokens or API keys:
#        grep -v '^#' .env.example \
#          | grep -En '(eyJ|AIza|AQ\.|gho_|sk-)' \
#          && echo "FAIL" || echo "PASS"
#   3. Confirm valid shell KEY="VALUE" syntax:
#        bash -n .env.example

# ==============================================================================
# BLOCK 5: CLOSING BLOCK
# ( Invariant Security Laws & Workspace Seal )
# ==============================================================================
# INVARIANT SECURITY LAWS:
#   1. Never commit `.env` containing live tokens or private keys to Git.
#   2. `.env` is permanently quarantined by `.gitignore` (Block 3.4).
#   3. Rotate any credential immediately if exposed in logs, scrolls, or diffs.
# Status: TEMPLATE_VERIFIED (+1:PROCEED)
# ==============================================================================
